OL,4,CTwo 18-year-olds injured in park       
OL,5,Cstabbing                               
OL,6,GTwo men have been stabbed in a Greater 
OL,7,GManchester park, with police still yet 
OL,8,Gto make any arrests.                   
OL,10,FThe 18-year-olds were found injured at 
OL,11,Fthe entrance of Alexandra Park in      
OL,12,FOldham after police were called        
OL,13,Fshortly before 17:00 GMT on Saturday.  
OL,15,FThe pair were treated for stab         
OL,16,Finjuries and taken to hospital. Their  
OL,17,Fconditions were not believed to be     
OL,18,Flife-threatening.                      
OL,22,                                   G4/4 
